{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>黃嘉雯（Carmaney）近日在社交平台連環分享了一輯旅行短片，原來她與好友前往東非坦桑尼亞旅行。片中，她們坐上吉普車近距離觀看獅子、長頸鹿、豹、大象等野生動物，又與同行夥伴圍着篝火跳舞、喝香檳，一如大家高喊的口號「Hakuna Matata」，整體氣氛自由奔放、熱烈愉快。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d564e6dd-e332-4e86-a5a8-fe41b1c683db.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20265AF2kLbmWF1789634377.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d564e6dd-e332-4e86-a5a8-fe41b1c683db.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_52ca258a276e552c-1174\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>此外，黃嘉雯亦拍攝了變裝片，連換4套風格截然不同的造型，包括貼身連身裙、斑馬紋跌膊look配純白牛仔褲，以及迷彩褲配背心，每套都各有魅力。影片曝光後，網民亦紛紛留言大讚：「型」、「好靚」！</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_52ca258a276e552c-1174\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5552f0f6-dba6-4884-9308-0e38477b60e3.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20263ENaiBn2YS1789634377.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5552f0f6-dba6-4884-9308-0e38477b60e3.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7ec7793a-2372-498f-8085-6e93ea4c3d93.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026yqPmQ8tcna1789634378.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7ec7793a-2372-498f-8085-6e93ea4c3d93.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cfc5205e-08b5-4508-886c-eb6798179fd5.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20269PDIWYglZW1789634378.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cfc5205e-08b5-4508-886c-eb6798179fd5.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e2b82196-295c-4e77-99bf-474dd4bfdb97.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026GO5XiG5str1789634378.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e2b82196-295c-4e77-99bf-474dd4bfdb97.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_52ca258a276e552c-1175\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>黃嘉雯最近在熱播劇《死有對証》中飾演單元一案件女主角「阮碧鳳」，角色被揭是連環兇手，黃嘉雯由柔弱秒變兇狠模樣展現巨大反差。此外，劇中陳曉華為黃嘉雯扣鈕的場面，更被網民指 call back《2019年香港小姐競選》決賽中陳曉華為冠軍黃嘉雯加冕的一幕，引發網民熱烈討論。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T09:21:05.716228+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":367,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}